                "fallback": "Leslie Tedgui on LinkedIn: :art:  Ever been through a brand refresh? Then you know—it’s a very thrilling…",
                "text": ":art: Ever been through a brand refresh? Then you know—it’s a very thrilling AND stressful rollercoaster(totally worth it) \n\nThis isn’t my first time leading one, and no matter how many times you go through it, it’s always a wild mix of excitement, pressure, and (let’s be honest) a few existential debates over font choices :sweat_smile: \n\nRefreshing a brand isn’t just about updating logos or colors—it’s about capturing the essence of who we are as a brand in a way that resonates with the world - and with the people who live and breathe it every day! \n\nThat means a lot of listening, a lot of iterating... and a few moments where you wonder if you’re overthinking that one shade of blue.\n\nAt CoachHub - The digital coaching platform, this process was no exception. It was a journey of balancing boldness with familiarity, innovation with authenticity—and making sure our refreshed identity feels just as inspiring to our team as it does to our clients.\n\nAnd after all the brainstorming, debating, and fine-tuning with the incredibly talented Giulia, Patryk, Bettina, Faris and Eduardo… we couldn’t be prouder of the results.\n\nSo here it is: the new era of CoachHub. Fresh, future-focused, and ready to take digital coaching to the next level!",
                "title": "Leslie Tedgui on LinkedIn: :art:  Ever been through a brand refresh? Then you know—it’s a very thrilling…",
